      "content": "redefine success... how? how do you redefine it when you've actually failed? everyone has already looked at me differently. i can't go back to being a student, i can't go back to being a researcher. there's no \"new path\" when the foundation is just gone. i just feel like there's no point in trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken. it feels like the only logical conclusion to all this effort and all this loss is that maybe it was never meant to be. maybe it's just time to give up.",
